# Build-context allowlist for the INTERNAL BOOTSTRAP service image.
#
# Separate from `gcloudignore` (the served API), `gcloudignore-generation`
# (the offline job) and `gcloudignore-projection` (the frozen A2 service).
# None of those three is modified.
#
# Identical narrowing to the A2 projection context, and for the same reason:
# the bootstrap service reads no workbook and no taxonomy, so it admits
# nothing from genex-parent at all.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-admit only the two pilot packages.

*

!pilot_backend/
!pilot_backend/**
!pilot_runtime/
!pilot_runtime/**

pilot_backend/tests/**
pilot_runtime/tests/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
